Z||000000||FieroMaster88||04-20-2001||02:42 PM||||Someone attempted to break into my car last night.  They ripped off the right side sail window, damaged the deck lid (completely chipped away the fiberglass in a big spot), Busted out my left side tail light and bent up the metal around my drivers side window. Man am I pissed.  There was like 5 other attempted break ins last night in my neignborhood, but the Fiero was the only one that was not gotten into.  They just messed it up really bad.  I am upset because my car will never be a Mint condition Fiero again!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">        <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles  <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif"> ||||reg||8
