Z||000010||FieroMaster88||04-27-2001||12:10 AM||||Well, The car is in the body shop.  Will be for 2 weeks.  THey did $1400 worth of damage to my baby.  BEst part is the friggin body shop cant find parts for the darn thing.  I had to find a bunch of them my self.  But hey.  all I have to pay for is my $100 deductiable.  It's all good.  Plus, some of the minor paint problems I had when I got the car are getting fixed....just too bad the back half of the car wont be origional paint any more.  But ooh well, just glad I still have it.  But man do I miss it.<P>I would also like to say thanks to Fleabitdog. HE sent me the parts I needed next day air and I have not sent him NE money for!!!!  He is a great guy.  UPS Sucks but hey, it's to be expected.  Thanks to everyone else who offered to help me and gave me advice!<P>Later<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">        <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles  <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif"> ||||reg||8
